@prefix hpc: <http://example.org/hpc#>
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>

hpc:Slurm a owl:Class.
hpc:Softwarelicense a owl:Class.
hpc:Locallicense a owl:Class.
hpc:Remotelicense a owl:Class.

hpc:slurmconf a owl:ObjectProperty.
hpc:Slurmconf a rdfs:domain hpc:Slurm.
hpc:licenses a owl:DatatypeProperty; rdfs:domain hpc:slurmconf.

hpc:licensename a owl:DatatypeProperty.
hpc:total a owl:DatatypeProperty; rdfs:domain hpc:licensename.
hpc:used a owl:
